    <briefdescription>
<para>VBAT threshold helper functions. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Provides functions to convert between voltage values and register values.</para>
<para><bold>Formula</bold>: V_BAT = register_value × 0.16208V register_value = V_BAT / 0.16208V</para>
<para>Valid range: 0V to ~41.4V (255 × 0.16208V) </para>
